{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_167_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_167","textTraditional":"一、十有八年。春，白狄來。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_167_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_167","textTraditional":"白狄者何？夷狄之君也。何以不言朝？不能朝也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_167_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_167","textTraditional":"二、夏，晉人執衞行人石買。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_167_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_167","textTraditional":"三、秋，齊師伐我北鄙。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_167_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_167","textTraditional":"四、冬十月，公會晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、邾婁子、滕子、薛伯、〈木巳〉伯、小邾婁子同圍齊。曹伯負芻卒于師。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_167_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_167","textTraditional":"五、楚公子午帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}